            <template>AbraFlexi Server Monitoring</template>
            <name>AbraFlexi Server Monitoring</name>
            <description>Comprehensive monitoring template for AbraFlexi server including:
- System metrics from /status.json endpoint
- Network connectivity and authentication monitoring  
- Low Level Discovery of companies
- Granular error detection for faster support response
- Performance monitoring and alerting</description>
